# Build/deploy hygiene — files excluded when deploying through the Vercel CLI.
# (Git-connected deployments clone the repo and build; this file keeps
# `vercel deploy` uploads lean so CLI and Git deploys match in size.)
#
# Storage context (v20 pass): everything under public/ ships inside EVERY
# deployment's output. The dead ORT wasm variants were cut from
# public/ghost/vendor/onnx/ — do not re-vendor all four variants; the engine
# only ever resolves the .jsep (WebGPU) and plain (wasm) builds because
# transformers.js forces wasm.proxy=false and never enables JSPI.
android/
harness/
tests/
system-ai/
scripts/
docs/
RIG-PLAN-V2.md
RIG-PLAN-V3.md
RIG-HANDOVER.md
AGENTS.md
CHANGELOG.md
visual-style.md
dev.log
